#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:2 95bd56b170d949f8a9d2adfc821c987d
msgid "_`Conanfile Configuration`"
msgstr "Conanfile 配置"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:5 26a1d0188c184399b7f03cf5d70bce42
msgid "_`Usage`"
msgstr "用法"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:7 b888d08efcc14ed2be84c1f75938b9de
msgid ""
"The conanfile.py is the Conan package configuration file for the fcpp "
"project, responsible for dependency management, package metadata "
"processing, and module generation."
msgstr ""
"conanfile.py 是 fcpp 项目的 Conan 包配置文件，负责依赖管理、包元数据处理"
"以及模块生成。"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:11 2b6c6ecff6994e6992fd385ef858da61
msgid "_`Main Features`"
msgstr "主要特性"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:13 d974ce143fb84b988307e39f1ae66d33
msgid "Project metadata initialization"
msgstr "项目元数据初始化"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:14 a3c183f926fe421397a7bd3cd5a53b70
msgid "Dependency management"
msgstr "依赖管理"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:15 f2cb540c50a74e5dbd92517445439c33
msgid "Module file generation and processing"
msgstr "模块文件生成与处理"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:16 8636afa3abc241bdafaae3606048d723
msgid "Build configuration generation"
msgstr "构建配置生成"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:17 13c68cce09594bae8152324b33ab48a6
msgid "Package information definition"
msgstr "包信息定义"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:20 04f30ccd2ec549e1b5bed23badf88062
msgid "_`Core Functionality`"
msgstr "核心功能"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:22 01e9701ec15f4856b50e2b0a0bab75a2
msgid ""
"The PackageRecipe class handles project initialization by loading "
"information from metadata.json. It processes module files by generating "
"them from .hpp and .cpp files, handling export and attach markers. "
"Dependency management is implemented by loading requirements from "
"conandata.yml."
msgstr ""
"PackageRecipe 类通过从 metadata.json 加载信息来处理项目初始化。它通过从"
".hpp 和 .cpp 文件生成模块文件来处理它们，并处理导出（export）和附加"
"（attach）标记。依赖管理是通过从 conandata.yml 加载需求来实现的。"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:26 613889e8e4154f0ea2d4ff39d9eafa86
msgid ""
"The configuration generates CMake toolchain and dependencies files, and "
"defines package components with their dependencies. Special features "
"include C header compatibility processing and comment marker handling for"
" export/attach operations."
msgstr ""
"该配置会生成 CMake 工具链和依赖文件，并定义带有依赖关系的包组件。特殊功能包括"
"C 头文件兼容性处理以及用于导出/附加操作的注释标记处理。"